{"id":"sl/hwbqtkby","index":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"標題及物件"},"title":"現況與改善重點","elements":[{"id":"sh/r65knqtk","kind":"textbox","name":"current-state-title","text":"現況與改善重點","position":{"left":18.83,"top":7.56,"width":1171.83,"height":56.69},"style":{"fontSize":38.4,"typeface":"Microsoft JhengHei","color":"#111111","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/9072xkry","kind":"textbox","name":"current-state-summary","text":"既有 POC 已驗證 RAG 與文件檢索的可行性，實際使用仍需補強查詢精準度與來源追溯。","position":{"left":57,"top":82,"width":1095,"height":64},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Microsoft JhengHei","color":"#3D3D3D","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"tb/lw72pgbi","kind":"table","text":"現況\t可能影響\n問題路由依賴關鍵字\t混合意圖的問題可能只命中部分內容\n文件採切片檢索\t主規定、例外條件及適用範圍可能分散於不同片段\nFAQ 與正式規範共同召回\t相似案例的條件不同，仍可能被直接套用\n交易必要條件未先檢查\t缺少主體、對象、金額或日期時，回答可能過度推論\n多種衍生資料並存\t回答需要額外比對原始文件及版本","position":{"left":57,"top":162,"width":1095,"height":328}},{"id":"sh/b29kza94","kind":"shape","name":"improvement-focus","position":{"left":57,"top":512,"width":1095,"height":74}},{"id":"sh/a10jqpsj","kind":"shape","name":"improvement-focus-accent","position":{"left":57,"top":512,"width":4.8,"height":74}},{"id":"sh/x4r21kru","kind":"textbox","name":"improvement-focus-title","text":"改善重點","position":{"left":85,"top":525,"width":135,"height":48},"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Microsoft JhengHei","color":"#111111","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","kind":"textbox","name":"improvement-focus-copy","text":"先確認問題類型與必要條件，再選擇適用來源，回答同時標示原始依據。","position":{"left":220,"top":525,"width":895,"height":48},"style":{"fontSize":17.33,"typeface":"Microsoft JhengHei","color":"#3D3D3D","alignment":"left"}}],"notes":{"text":"內容依據：\n/Users/ckwang/Projects/work/temp/stakeholder-qa-assistant/POC/stakeholders QA assistant/rag_optimized_output/retrieval_profiles.json\n/Users/ckwang/Projects/work/temp/stakeholder-qa-assistant/POC/stakeholders QA assistant/rag_optimized_output/retrieval_strategy.md\n/Users/ckwang/Projects/wo